<b>Contents</b>
<p>
<A HREF="#intro" TARGET="SBN_text">Introduction</A>
<BR><A HREF="#work" TARGET="SBN_text">How Does it Work?</A>
<BR><A HREF="#use" TARGET="SBN_text">How Do I Use it?</A>
<BR><A HREF="#cache" TARGET="SBN_text">How Do I Make My COM Object Cacheable?</A>
<BR><A HREF="#hey" TARGET="SBN_text">Hey, I'm no C++ Programmer, Just Show Me How to Script it!</A>
